cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use citeformer in academic work, please cite it."
title: "citeformer: structurally unforgeable citations from language models"
abstract: >-
  A Python library that makes citation fabrication structurally impossible
  at the logit level via grammar-constrained decoding, with deterministic
  CSL bibliography rendering and NLI-based claim verification.
type: software
authors:
